OL,3,GNEWSAChemical Brothers to headline
OL,4,AKendal Calling
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Chemical Brothers and Blossoms have
OL,7,Fbeen announced as headliners for Kendal
OL,8,FCalling 2027.
OL,10,FThe remaining headline acts for the
OL,11,Ffour-day festival at Lowther Deer Park,
OL,12,Fin Cumbria, have also been revealed as
OL,13,FBlack Eyed Peas and Jamie T.
OL,15,FThe festival will take place from
OL,16,FThursday 29 July until Sunday 1 August
OL,17,Fand will feature more than 100 acts,
OL,18,Fincluding musicians and comedians.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
